              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is \"quick and easy\" plus it's a nice twist on a classic that goes great with tomato soup! I used sourdough bread and added the herbs to the butter before spreading on the bread. I also added a slice or two of tomato to give it even more pizzaz. This one of my all time favorites! Thanks for a great recipe!"
